{"ts":"2026-07-29T13:44:03.703Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"02d426513ea6e0fba843bb0c","agent_provenance":{"model":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-qhnq6t"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-808: lifecycle completion resolver types and provenance lie when no timestamp exists"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"The published resolveCompletionTimestamp SDK primitive accepts empty legacy metadata at runtime while its declaration requires updated_at; it returns no timestamp while declaring timestamp as required, and reports updated_at as the source even when no field supplied a value. Correct the public contract with an explicit unresolved outcome so TypeScript consumers need no unsafe casts and provenance never invents a source."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:sdk","lifecycle","provenance","regression","types"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-29T13:44:03.703Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-29T13:44:03.703Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"TypeScript callers can pass metadata with optional completed_at, closed_at, and updated_at without assertions; The unresolved result cannot be mistaken for a resolved timestamp and credits no metadata field; Runtime, declarations, docs, public surface, and packed-consumer tests agree"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-usfg"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":95},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Call resolveCompletionTimestamp({}) from @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.7.29 and compare the emitted object with dist/sdk/lifecycle-completion.d.ts."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"The SDK input admits legacy metadata with every candidate timestamp absent, and the result is a discriminated contract whose resolved branch always has a timestamp/source while its unresolved branch has neither."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"The declaration requires updated_at and a returned timestamp, but runtime accepts an empty object, omits timestamp, and falsely attributes the unresolved value to updated_at."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/affected_version","value":"2026.7.29"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/component","value":"sdk/lifecycle-completion"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/regression","value":true},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-bwnclq","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-07-29T13:44:03.703Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-usfg","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-07-29T13:44:03.703Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-07-29T13:44:03.703Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check: searched all statuses for resolveCompletionTimestamp, lifecycle-completion, completion timestamp source/fallback, and GH-675 lineage. pm-bwnclq is closed and correctly owns the shipped completion feature; no live item owns this distinct public type/runtime/provenance regression reported by GH-808."}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"29b7643264bd84e2d64b76b28ce88ce434fe4e369197b0d451dc0058fe47e083","message":"Create canonical GH-808 SDK contract regression after all-status duplicate search"}
